OL,3,AYemen's Houthis seize strategic Red Sea
OL,4,Aport of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Yemeni government forces
OL,7,Fwithdrew from the island of Perim in
OL,8,Fthe Bab el-Mandeb Strait, according to
OL,9,Fofficials, with witnesses reporting
OL,10,Fthat Houthi forces moved onto the
OL,11,Fisland.
OL,13,FThe strait is the southern gateway to a
OL,14,Fkey shipping route that links Asia and
OL,15,FEurope via the Red Sea and Suez canal.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
